WEBVTT

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.720
Steal Finis and the train he's riding in?!

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:05.600
Yeah.

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:09.920
I found out he'll be boarding 
a train to London in two weeks

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:12.610
to inspect a war plant on the north side.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:17.840
The plan is to strike there and abduct 
Finis, the leader of Twilight.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.170
Thank you for coming.

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:28.500
Think of this as a personal 
request from me,

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:30.460
Herlock Sholmes.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.720
As you wish, Your Majesty.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.760
You are not only clever, but skilled.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.560
It would be no surprise if you 
had been knighted long ago.

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:45.260
I am unworthy of such an honor.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:47.360
Such a shrewd man...

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:53.150
However, this is a mission I entrust to you 
precisely because you have no standing.

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:57.730
I would like you to accompany someone 
on an inspection as his escort.

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:59.810
Would that someone be...

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:03.860
the leader of the British intelligence 
organization, Twilight,

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:05.280
the man named Finis?

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:13.050
His inspection of the war plant was 
abruptly decided only days ago.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:17.640
Given that you chose me, a man 
of no standing, I gather that

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:21.200
the escort task is merely a cover, 
and I am to observe him.

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:23.290
You truly are clever.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.730
I will gladly accept your request.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:30.030
As it happens, there is something 
of concern to me, as well.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:34.150
And that has something 
to do with my request?

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:37.410
All things are connected.

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:39.220
Queries and misgivings,

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:42.160
at any two points, form a straight 
line where you least expect it.

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:45.270
Call it a detective's intuition.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:21.470
Train Snatch

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.610
I'm sorry. Am I intruding?

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:48.110
C'mon in.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:50.370
You're up early.

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:52.080
I couldn't sleep.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.550
Nervous?

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:57.590
Don't stress so much. I get it.

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.480
Today's the day we execute our plan.

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:01.630
Who wouldn't be nervous?

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:06.390
Even for me, it was all I could do 
at first to just act as I'd been taught.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:10.250
Relax. You're an excellent student.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:14.490
Of course, having a thief for a teacher 
is nothing to brag about...

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:18.400
You've taught me many things, Lupin.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.400
And not just techniques.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.030
You told me that it's okay 
for me to be here.

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:28.400
You taught me that it's 
fun to be with everyone.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:49.800
Sisi!

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:53.980
Oh... M-Maybe he's hungry...

00:04:56.900 --> 00:05:00.520
I'll get him something. 
You rest for a bit.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:09.710
Are you two...

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.360
in that kind of relationship?

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.320
Van— No, we're not!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:22.590
Jeez, how long are you gonna 
keep sulking, Drac?

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:24.850
Don't call me Drac, you insolent clod!

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:27.340
Why must I stay behind?

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.520
The noble there is going, is he not?

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:31.760
Well, I am an adult, after all.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:36.090
Stop treating me like a child!

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.470
Drac?

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:40.970
Will you look after Sisi for me?

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:46.110
If you insist, I suppose I have no choice.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:51.120
You really are an angel, Cardia!

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:52.600
All right, then.

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:56.430
Let's go over the program for today's show.

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:02.880
The train carrying Finis and his 
party leaves the station at noon.

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:05.890
Our target is this saloon car.

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:09.320
First, Van and Fran will take 
control of the engine room.

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.630
I'll take over driving the train.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:17.400
Van will take out Finis's escorts on 
his way to take over the saloon car.

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:21.560
Cardia and I will infiltrate 
the end car and stand by.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.230
Once the train departs,

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:26.400
we'll wait for an opportunity to lure 
the escorts into the rear cars.

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:27.900
The way we'll do it is...

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:29.650
All ready!

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:32.980
We'll cut through the cars with fewer guards

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:35.030
and capture the rear end of the saloon car.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.530
Then, we'll uncouple it.

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:40.070
Once we've isolated Finis,

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:43.500
we'll redirect the train 
onto this branch line.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.400
And this will be the last stop.

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.550
The surrounding area is a deep ravine.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:50.680
It won't be easy for him to escape.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:55.190
I'll use my automobile 
to get there before the train.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:58.070
From there, we only need 
to take Finis with us.

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:03.100
Abducting the entire 
train with him in it...

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.290
Oh, by the way, Cardia,

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.240
I have something to give you.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:09.970
Here.

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:20.340
A pillow!

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.830
It's designed so that the 
poison won't get through.

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:24.770
I finally finished it.

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:29.610
Well, she looks happy, so that's nice...

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:31.540
but was this really the time?

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:32.830
It's the perfect time.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:36.090
I actually have one more present for you.

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:42.430
So cute!

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:44.130
That looks good on you.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.260
You look beautiful, indeed.

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:49.230
It will be much easier 
to move in that outfit.

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:51.480
That'll be an advantage in a fight.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.250
Is that all you think about?

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.330
No girl's ever gonna want him.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.220
Foolishness.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:58.720
I'm so happy.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:02.500
Thank you so much, Fran.

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:07.240
All right, then, is everyone ready?

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:09.890
Time to start the show!

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:19.160
Well, this is where we separate.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:23.270
You guys have the most dangerous 
part in this. Don't go overboard.

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:26.230
Fran, be careful. You too, Van.

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:30.200
I hope you remember 
everything I taught you.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:33.320
Don't do anything that's 
beyond your abilities.

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:34.970
And...

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:38.810
The attack with the highest 
success rate is a body blow.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:40.840
Be careful.

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:43.590
Well, we'll see you later.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:28.610
You're so rough.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:32.630
You won't catch me sneaking
 around like some petty thief.

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.600
Hey, Saint.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:40.990
Impey, how goes it?

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:44.010
My cute little machine is all ready.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:47.400
All that's left is waiting 
for her turn to shine.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:49.010
I'm glad to hear that.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.670
The train should have departed by now.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:54.170
I'll head for the bridge now.

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:56.020
You should be moving along, too.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:58.010
Yeah, I know.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:05.040
The wind...

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:18.310
Well, ready to get started?

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.560
I'll do my best.

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:43.110
That's the rear car! Let's go!

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:43.570
Sir!

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:55.120
Jeez... Impey really took that one too far.

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:56.740
Do you think it will work?

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:59.340
I hope so. Come on, let's go.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:14.280
Fire! Fire!

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.350
<i>They're reacting too readily.</i>

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:25.360
<i>Could that mean...</i>

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:30.480
Good. Looks like everything's going well.

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:31.730
Thank goodness.

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:33.890
But we're really just getting started.

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.830
This will destroy the coupler.

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:41.120
Cardia, I'm leaving this with you.

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:45.170
I'll have to fight any 
enemies that find us.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:47.240
I'm counting on you to attach this.

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:49.380
You think I can do it?

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:52.840
Couplers aren't easy to detach 
while the train is moving.

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:56.160
Even this device might not 
destroy it completely.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:02.320
But if it doesn't, you have the ability 
to melt it with your poison.

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:03.640
You're perfect.

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:17.180
We'll have to take care of this fast, 
or Impey won't be able to do anything.

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:21.680
I suspected we would meet.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:27.430
This means our destinies were fated to 
come together at this place and time...

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:31.960
Gentleman thief, Arsène Lupin.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.800
Lupin, do you know him?

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:51.340
Can't say I do. He doesn't 
look like a British soldier.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:54.930
My name is Herlock Sholmes.

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:56.890
I'm just an ordinary detective.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:58.510
Detective?

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:02.500
In other words, your mortal 
enemy, Arsène Lupin.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.950
After all of your thieving 
theatrics in London,

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:09.300
you've been lying low for a while.

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:12.200
It was almost like the calm before a storm.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:15.320
I suspected something might soon happen,

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:18.570
but it seems you've cooked up
 quite a daring scheme.

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:22.490
If you know all that, this'll be quick.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:25.600
We don't have much time. 
Could you stay out of our way?

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:26.980
I can't do that.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:31.780
It's the detective's job to 
catch the thief, is it not?

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:34.300
Did you not hear me?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.410
I said I don't have time 
to play around with you!

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:43.730
Sleeping gas. Take a little nap.

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:45.220
Let's go, Cardia.

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:48.670
Lupin!

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:52.590
Please don't underestimate me.

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:56.920
A gas attack is easily handled 
if one sees it coming.

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:00.620
Lupin, look!

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:05.600
Cardia, leave this to me!

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:06.580
Go by yourself!

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:08.310
But—

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:09.960
Go! I'm counting on you!

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.630
You little—

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:37.140
That's a cute little apprentice you have.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:41.570
But I don't approve of sending 
a lady off by herself.

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:43.760
This train is filled with dangers.

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:48.280
You don't want to 
underestimate my princess.

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:53.310
Curse you!

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:57.870
Van!

00:14:58.480 --> 00:15:00.220
Nice body blow.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:04.510
Go ahead.

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:14.400
That's it.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:21.280
You did it, Cardia!

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.390
There it is!

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:39.870
I've been relieved from my post.

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:44.070
What do you want to do? See this through 
to the end, since we're here?

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:46.370
I'll gladly take you on.

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:48.620
Gotcha.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:16:01.360
Sorry about that! I try to 
avoid unnecessary fighting!

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.110
An ornithopter...

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:05.860
I can't believe he had such 
a thing up his sleeve.

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:08.470
If it's a detective's job to chase a thief,

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:10.850
then it's a thief's job to escape!

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:14.860
Savor that frustration until 
we meet again, Mr. Detective!

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:23.920
They say if you become obsessed, 
you'll never get what you're after, but...

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:26.920
Arsène Lupin.

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:30.750
Now I want to capture you even more.

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:33.930
Impey, should this thing 
be shaking so much?!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:37.750
I can't help it! This thing's 
made to carry one!

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:40.270
Impey! Impey! Can you hear me?

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:42.380
What's up, Saint?

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:47.100
Listen to me. You must not come here.

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:48.600
The operation has failed.

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:55.470
There's no one here?

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:58.280
Cardia!

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.370
Be careful, Aleister.

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:04.370
That gun will melt if it touches her skin.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:05.820
Finis!

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:09.520
Long time no see, Abraham Van Helsing.

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:13.800
You look as though you'd
 like to kill me right now.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:19.010
But that would go against your 
group's plan, wouldn't it?

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.600
It's over...

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.710
What's going on?

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:37.350
If they keep going, it'll be 
a suicide pact for all of them!

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:44.040
A British Army airship?!

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:45.590
They got us...

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:47.930
Cardia...

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:52.050
That's right.

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:57.510
I was the one who leaked the 
information that I'd be on this train!

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:02.720
That means... you're the ones who 
were lured into my birdcage!

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:07.110
Why would you...

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.530
Isn't it obvious?

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.250
Because I wanted to finally meet you.

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:16.620
We finally meet, my dear sister.

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:21.140
Sister?

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:26.080
That's right. We are siblings 
who share the same father.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:30.050
We are the only two children 
he had to carry on his wishes.

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:32.140
Your father is...

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:35.620
Isaac Beckford.

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:39.260
Poor thing... You're so confused.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:42.630
I guess that's natural. You know nothing...

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:45.890
Why you have no memories 
from before you awakened,

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:49.650
or what that poison residing 
in your body is,

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:53.650
or why that thing is 
embedded in your chest.

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:57.140
I'll explain it all to you in detail later.

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:58.900
Everything about Father, too.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:01.320
About Father?

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:04.150
So come, my sister.

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:06.910
Come with me.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.960
You think I'll let you do that?

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:17.320
The Van I knew long ago 
would've shot me by now.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:20.660
The fact that I stand here unharmed

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:23.670
must mean that you've changed, as well.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:27.260
Van...

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:30.700
Aleister, bring my sister over here.

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:36.690
Van!

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:41.850
Cardia!

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:43.740
Come on!

00:19:46.840 --> 00:19:48.160
Jump over here!

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:50.280
Aleister!

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:51.430
Don't let her get away!

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:54.690
Go!

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:01.390
Lupin, hurry it up!

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:03.170
Cardia, it's okay!

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:05.930
Trust me!

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:09.670
Sister!

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:21.810
Next time, I will shoot you.

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:43.900
Hey!

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:45.940
We're in serious trouble here!

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:00.330
Looks like they managed to escape, too.

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:03.940
Visibility is poor! We can't pursue them!

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:08.360
We'll meet again soon, my sister.

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:23.800
We fell for it hook, line, and sinker.

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:30.230
<i>What is this throbbing ache?</i>

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:34.620
<i>The chill I felt in the brief 
touch of your fingers...</i>

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:36.660
<i>I do know it.</i>

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:41.400
<i>That's the feeling I have, Finis.</i>

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:18.280
Oh? What a strange turn of events.

00:23:18.810 --> 00:23:22.610
This is nothing at all 
like the report I gave.

00:23:23.470 --> 00:23:28.980
I wish you the best until 
we meet again, Arsène Lupin.
